From: Kodarai Dev <dev@kodarai.xyz>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 23:35:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] /start: lean landing variant (default); full page kept at
 ?v=full

- Lean page: rotating headline, short subline, first quiz question inline
  (tapping an option starts the quiz and fires funnel_started), proof video
  slot with Finder screenshot as poster, plain-English strip, 3 short steps,
  collapsed FAQ, final CTA, sticky mobile CTA after 520px scroll
- Trimmed from lean: how-it-works, example card, workflow, reviews and proof
  gallery sections (still on /start?v=full)
- Fires start_variant_viewed {variant: lean|full}
- Optional: add public/start/finder-loop.mp4 (muted 6-10s Finder recording)
---
